3b. Build the port (Node-API addon, Python extension, shared library)

Usage: mojo-anything build [OPTIONS] [CRATE_DIR]

Arguments:
  [CRATE_DIR]
          [default: .]

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Target: this machine

          Possible values:
          - host: This machine
          
          [default: host]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
